  {
    question: "Are you based in the Netherlands?",
    answer: "No. BtechWaleTech is a small team of engineers based in India, and we work with businesses in the Netherlands remotely. We have no office, KvK registration, postal address or staff in the Netherlands. You work directly with the three engineers who plan, build and maintain your website or software.",
