  },
  {
    question: "Do your invoices include Dutch VAT (BTW)?",
    answer: "No. We are based outside the EU and our invoices carry no Dutch BTW. When a Dutch business buys services from a supplier outside the EU, the reverse charge (btw verlegd) usually applies and the business accounts for the VAT in its own return. Your accountant or boekhouder should confirm the treatment for your situation.",
  },
  {
    question: "Can you build a webshop with iDEAL through Mollie?",
